Model
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
backend/model/effnet_sqrt_finetuned.keras comes unchanged from the author's
WashMom Vision project: https://github.com/denizkaratass/WashMom-Vision
(same CC BY-NC 4.0 license). backend/model/effnet_sqrt_finetuned.onnx is the
same model with the same weights, converted to the ONNX format with
backend/tools/convert_to_onnx.py; it is covered by the same license and the
same dataset restrictions below.

