-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pretrained weights and libraries
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The EfficientNetV2B0 backbone was initialized with ImageNet weights provided
by Keras / TensorFlow (Apache License 2.0). The backend uses ONNX Runtime
(MIT), OpenCV (Apache License 2.0), simplejpeg (MIT) and FastAPI (MIT); the
one-off conversion tool uses TensorFlow, Keras and tf2onnx (Apache License
2.0). Frontend dependencies keep their own licenses (see
frontend/package.json).
